completes her Gunpla Beargguy III (San), and when a painting of it wins the grand prize at the local art exhibit, her rival Caroline Yajima issues her a Gunpla challenge.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ejnUvXRYSBRNukgVCfTCZdF3llW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejnUvXRYSBRNukgVCfTCZdF3llW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1385963","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the 7th Gunpla Battle World Championships begins in Shizuoka, the Gunpla community is in shock when news spreads of reigning champion Carlos Kaiser's defeat at the hands of Aila. Meanwhile, Sei meets the other Gunpla Fighters at the opening party while Reiji encounters Aila at the nearby mall.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gAw5jrHGoc5u9LNRBH36iyDLOD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gAw5jrHGoc5u9LNRBH36iyDLOD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1385964","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuuki makes his World Championship debut as PPSE's Meijin Kawaguchi. Meanwhile, on the second day of the tournament, all of the participants must face each other in a battle royal until only one-third of the lineup remains.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/89r1P3pxGvHWmdmpeUB3lmDMKuF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/89r1P3pxGvHWmdmpeUB3lmDMKuF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1385965","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With an unmanned Mega Size Model Zaku sent in to eliminate the Star Build Strike Gundam in the middle of the battle royal, unlikely alliances are formed while Sei and Reiji must unleash Star Build Strike Gundam's trump card to survive.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQ8teZFv83pjv7L6fygMHTG6nnf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pQ8teZFv83pjv7L6fygMHTG6nnf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"1385966","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"For day three of the tournament, containers with random weapons are placed in the battlefield for the Gunpla Fighters to use in their battle; each contestant is assigned a container number to use. Sei and Reiji are assigned to battle Luang Dallara, who already gave them trouble at the battle royal. Worsening the situation is Reiji's wrist injury from a street fight outside the arena grounds.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rHF5C8JLyu27mumOB7FhIHBRAJC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rHF5C8JLyu27mumOB7FhIHBRAJC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"1385967","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sei and Reiji remain undefeated by the sixth period of the tournament with two more to go, despite Reiji's wrist injury. However, another obstacle appears in front of them in the form of the Gunpla Fighter named \"C\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5UDTX7NC8qb3bF3m3IQ81Gy18Dq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5UDTX7NC8qb3bF3m3IQ81Gy18Dq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1385968","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With their loss in the Gunpla race dropping them to 17th place, Sei and Reiji must leave no room for error in the eighth period of the tournament in order to make it to the finals. However, they have to go through Fellini in the process.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Di7rT3WZGqloO16CcjYcxKtBZj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Di7rT3WZGqloO16CcjYcxKtBZj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60667/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1385969","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Rinko leaves home to join her son, Sei and Reiji's battle with Fellini ends in a draw, but they earn two points, which is enough to land them in the top 16 in the finals. Meanwhile, following a heated argument with Sei over rebuilding the Star Build Strike Gundam, Reiji goes out to buy his own Gunpla, only for him and Aila to receive a crash course in Gunpla building by a mysterious bearded man.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jnJLzr6Zb5mHYJzb6Ay0tcE6Mej.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnJLzr6Zb5mHYJzb6Ay0tcE6Mej.jpg","language":"xx"}]